  "body": "### What are you trying to do\n\nOne of the shortcomings of Fusion360 is still after several years, the inability to import manufacturer *.STP models for simulation and collision avoidance. This is useful in particular for lathe tooling which may be unsymmetrical for things like Sandvik and Kennametal tooling.\n-Kennametal KM Tooling: ISO 26622\n-Sandvik Coromant Capto Tooling: ISO 26623\n\n### How you imagine it working\n\nI imagine this working like the tool library features in MasterCAM or NX where the actual simulated tool is base off of manufacturers models for when there are odd shaped tooling like\n\n<img width=\"1463\" height=\"543\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ddadd53d-7fb9-41c2-b190-d024c9f9c42a\" />\n\n ",
